# cards: a worn card at 0 points (docs/plan-cards.md 2.4). Lucia wears Quetzalcoatl with 100 points (one use).
# Round 1: Jian Fights, Lucia uses the card: points 100 -> 0, the card stays in the bag (0x0213BA1B = 1) and no
# "Lost" line. Round 2: Lucia's Special list still shows it, greyed (shot ce_list), and A on it is refused.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u16 0x020B48AC 100
poke u16 0x020B46FE 236
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u16 0x020B48AC points
watch u8 0x0213BA1B in_bag
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 200
shot ce_after_use
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ce_list
press A 8
wait 60
shot ce_refused
